===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|smal}}, from {{inh|en|ang|smæl||small, narrow, slender}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*smalaz||small}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*(s)mal-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*(s)mel-||small, mean, malicious}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|smal}}; {{m|sco|sma||small}}; {{cog|fy|smel||narrow}}; {{cog|nl|smal||narrow}}; {{cog|de|schmal||narrow, small}}; {{cog|da|-}}, {{cog|no|-}}, {{cog|sv|smal|t=narrow; thin; slender}}; {{cog|la|malus||bad}}; {{cog|ru|ма́лый||small}}.

